      <div class="setting__head"><h2>The shape of the morning</h2><p>Ninety minutes, roughly in this order.</p></div>
      <ol class="shape">
        <li><b>Coffee from ten.</b> In the hall. Genuinely good since 2023.</li>
        <li><b>Three or four songs.</b> Words on the screen. Standing is optional.</li>
        <li><b>A reading and prayers.</b> Led from the front; nothing is asked of you.</li>
        <li><b>The sermon, thirty-five minutes.</b> On the passage, in the book we are working through. Recorded and on the site by Monday evening.</li>
        <li><b>Children go out</b> to their groups, or stay. Both are normal.</li>
        <li><b>A final song, and more coffee.</b> For as long as anybody wants it.</li>
      </ol>
